COMMENT ON TABLE "org_finza"."ai_playground_sessions" IS 'Sessao do Playground de IA (PG.4, IAF-3989). Criada ANTES da 1a mensagem; snapshot de version_id/agente/cenario/modo (real|fictitious)/contrato/contato selecionado + webhook + created_by + timestamps. Chave natural conversation_id (UNIQUE) => reload/retry da mesma conversa reusa a sessao (idempotente). Escrita/leitura via authenticated (playground e sandbox) + service_role (EF ai-playground / callback).';



