COMMENT ON COLUMN "org_finza"."campaign_logs"."skipped_cross_integration" IS 'Count of actions skipped due to cross-campaign integration deduplication.
This prevents duplicate messages when:
- Contact has contracts in multiple portfolios
- Different campaigns target each portfolio
- BUT they use the same integration (e.g., same WhatsApp channel)
Contact receives only ONE message per integration per action_type per day.';



